note Render-track level (blog renders): the board pose comes only from a replay file (ADR-0009), so nothing here reaches the physics. tools/trail/verify_trail.py checks the tyre against the generated surface along the track (within 7.5 mm of the course heightfield); that check is outside the ADR-0011 pipeline, so the status stays unverified. Declared by the game play track so the check stays honest; the render track owns the content.

